   },
   "ruling": "Ruling (genuine ambiguity; project refuses the class): in the archived layout text (p946.txt p. 107) the values 50, 20 and 50 are printed on the line of the unnumbered heading \"Electric, Gas, Water, and Steam Utility Services: Includes assets used in the production, transmission, and distribution of electricity, gas, steam, or water for sale including related land improvements\", and no values are printed on the lines of 49.11 \"Electric Utility Hydraulic Production Plant\". The second transcription gave the heading's values to 49.11. Which class the printed values belong to cannot be settled from the page, so 49.11 is given the period outside and refused; utility production plant is not property of a Schedule C business in this tool's scope."
  },
